control: A sealed value opens only with the private key it was sealed to, and an altered, truncated or re-versioned value is refused
removes: the version byte is never checked, so a value under any version byte opens
packages: ./credential/open ./credential/seal
tests: TestEveryAlterationIsRefused/every_other_version_byte TestSplitRefusesATruncatedOrReversionedValue
scheduled-count: no

